    "turn_text": "So you mentioned Afghanistan, you're a veteran of Afghanistan. And so do you agree with the decision to remove troops or disagree with it, just on the way he's doing it or do you agree with it in general? Do you think that, how do you think that the US's policy towards Afghanistan should be in the future?",
