    "turn_text": "Yeah, definitely know you're coming from on that one. On the issue of Iran, you already mentioned it. We already know that the Biden administration is having backdoor talks with Iran. You've called this a scandal in the past. And you strongly opposed his efforts to enter the Iran deal, which the Biden administration is quite openly trying to reenter. I know, I believe just yesterday, you introduced the maximum pressure act, along with, I believe, was 83 of your colleagues. other than the Republican study committee. And this is basically what UV was there, what should be the Republican approach to Iran vis-à-vis the Biden approach to Iran, which is very different. Can you tell me more about this legislation and what you hope it can accomplish?",
