  {
    "episode_id": 76370,
    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/7/6/76370.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 14,
    "turn_text": "So in terms of the long term you think that how do you think this legislation will affect the long term strategy in Iran regardless of whose president I mean whoever is president you basically you're saying that Congress ought to play a bigger role in in the foreign policy towards Iran and making sure that we have a consistent policy is kind of what I'm hearing you say. Yes.",
